  "limits": [
    "No human auditory listening test or real-game test is claimed.",
    "Whisper misrecognizes sung words and is used only as rough independent syllable timing evidence.",
    "Gradual vocal attacks and releases have no single exact boundary; these are inspected instrumental arrangement decisions, not accuracy guarantees.",
    "Breath noise, vocal slides, vibrato, dynamics, harmony and recording reverb are not reproduced.",
    "The displayed BPM is nominal; per-note fractional durations preserve the reviewed recording timeline.",
    "Index 68a is a discrete D4-to-C4 transition inside a continuously sung syllable, not an independent vocal attack; key changes and the 10 ms gap approximate the original legato slide.",
